      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates take great pleasure in presenting no. 7A Binn Eadair View to the market for sale. This is a well presented south facing 3-bedroom terraced family home located within an extremely popular and highly sought after coastal neighbourhood. This charming spacious home is within minutes’ walk to Sutton DART Station, Sutton Cross and the seafront promenade.\r\nThe property offers well proportioned bright and spacious living accommodation complimented with a south facing rear garden. Local recreational and leisure facilities abound with many facilities on the doorstep. There is an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools in the area. Suitable for small families, first time buyers or those looking to trade down to something chic and more manageable.\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. Drive in to the front. Lawned south facing rear garden with patio and rear access. Viewing is very highly recommended!\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nPorch Tiled floor\r\nEntrance Hall Under stairs storage and coved ceiling.\r\nGuest WC WC, whb, tiled walls and floor.\r\nLiving Room 5.65m x 3.00m Coved ceiling, feature cast iron fireplace with tiled insert and double doors leading to:\r\nKitchen/dining room 4.80m x 4.00m Wall and floor mounted units. Part tiled walls, plumbed for dishwasher, dado rail, coved ceiling and sliding patio door leading to south facing rear garden.\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding  \r\nWith hot press and attic access. Potential to convert the attic. \r\nBedroom 1) 3.00m x 4.00m Fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2) 3.95m x 2.60m Fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3) 2.75m x 2.12m\r\nBathroom Bath with shower attachment, w.c, w.h.b, spot lighting, heated towel rail, tiled walls and floor.\r\nOutside Drive in to the front. Lawned south facing rear garden with patio and pedestrian rear access."
      },
